mori::check::uses_non_intent

  × An action must use an intent, but `price` is a `const`.
   ╭─[test.mori:4:19]
 2 │ agreement Invoice {
 3 │   const price = 10;
   ·         ──┬──
   ·           ╰── declared with `const` here
 4 │   action pay uses price;
   ·                   ──┬──
   ·                     ╰── this must name an intent
 5 │ }
   ╰────
  help: An action runs an intent declared above it:

            intent invoice = { ... };
            action pay uses invoice;
